WEBVTT

00:07.173 --> 00:09.801
[sweet airy music]

00:42.834 --> 00:45.253
[rain clattering]

00:46.212 --> 00:48.381
Are you finished yet? Where is Yeon-su?

00:48.465 --> 00:51.509
Oh, we didn't know it would
suddenly rain so much here today.

00:51.593 --> 00:53.678
So, so I was getting this.

00:53.762 --> 00:55.805
So Ms. Kook is still on standby too.

00:55.889 --> 00:56.931
Oh, right.

00:57.599 --> 00:59.976
I think we should just call it a day.
It's pouring really bad.

01:00.060 --> 01:03.897
All right. I'll go get Ms. Kook then.
She probably doesn't have an umbrella.

01:04.939 --> 01:06.149
No, I'll go.

01:09.986 --> 01:11.071
What?

01:12.280 --> 01:14.532
Did you only decide
to work on this project

01:16.076 --> 01:18.036
because Ms. Kook would be here too?

01:19.245 --> 01:21.748
[rain clattering]

01:24.584 --> 01:26.169
[soft sigh]

01:29.380 --> 01:31.299
Um, where is she? Tell me.

01:31.382 --> 01:33.676
[groans]
Why is it raining so much today?

01:35.053 --> 01:37.430
[Ji-ung] I hate it when things
don't go according to plan.

01:37.514 --> 01:39.766
[sighs]
I wonder where we should shoot the rest.

01:42.685 --> 01:44.062
[gasps]

01:46.564 --> 01:48.483
Anything out of my control,

01:50.235 --> 01:51.903
I treat it as a risk factor.

01:54.948 --> 01:56.032
Back then and even now,

01:57.200 --> 01:58.868
Yeon-su is someone like that to me.

02:00.995 --> 02:02.705
The first time I saw Yeon-su…

02:06.042 --> 02:08.503
Never mind, it's not that important.

02:10.713 --> 02:13.758
["Drawer" by 10CM playing]

02:15.969 --> 02:17.887
It doesn't matter who liked her first.

02:18.388 --> 02:20.348
[Yeon-su and Ung chuckling]

02:20.431 --> 02:23.518
I ended up becoming the jerk
who liked his friend's girlfriend.

02:26.187 --> 02:29.357
Because of that,
I had to keep making plans instead…

02:31.651 --> 02:32.527
[gasps]

02:36.239 --> 02:39.284
Plans to not cross the line, ever.

02:40.827 --> 02:43.037
["Drawer" by 10CM continues]

02:44.664 --> 02:45.707
[groans]

02:48.501 --> 02:51.713
Hey, Yeon-su and I are going to eat
at our restaurant. Join us.

02:52.589 --> 02:54.632
[Ji-ung] And I didn't want
to become somebody

02:54.716 --> 02:57.260
who would teeter between
friendship and love like a kid.

02:57.343 --> 02:58.261
I'm busy.

02:58.344 --> 03:01.055
What do you mean you're busy?
You're reading a comic book.

03:01.139 --> 03:03.141
Well, I just finished and now…

03:03.224 --> 03:04.392
I have homework.

03:04.475 --> 03:05.643
[groans]

03:05.727 --> 03:09.147
Hey, I know that
Yeon-su is kind of weird, but…

03:09.230 --> 03:11.858
you're being too obvious
about hating her, okay?

03:11.941 --> 03:13.192
[Ung] She's my girlfriend.

03:13.276 --> 03:14.819
- It's nothing like that.
- [scoffs]

03:14.903 --> 03:16.905
But why do I feel like
you're actively avoiding her?

03:16.988 --> 03:18.239
Come on, that's crazy.

03:18.323 --> 03:20.575
Just stop the nonsense and go already.

03:20.658 --> 03:23.286
- She'll yell at you. Get out of here.
- Hm.

03:24.078 --> 03:26.497
[Ji-ung] When I first realized it,
it was really hard for me.

03:26.581 --> 03:28.166
- [Ung] Fine, see you--
- By the way,

03:28.249 --> 03:30.043
you're a lot weirder than she is.

03:30.126 --> 03:31.127
[scoffs]

03:34.797 --> 03:37.884
[Ji-ung] But then,
I got used to it after a while.

03:37.967 --> 03:39.218
[deep sigh]

03:40.762 --> 03:42.180
My plans were simple.

03:44.349 --> 03:46.726
[Yeon-su panting]

03:46.809 --> 03:48.394
Oh, Ji-ung, can you give me a ride…

03:50.146 --> 03:52.398
[Ji-ung] Don't get involved
in any encounters.

03:52.482 --> 03:53.524
Oh, darn it.

03:53.608 --> 03:54.484
[sighs]

03:57.946 --> 03:59.155
[groans]

03:59.239 --> 04:00.782
Yeon-su and I broke up.

04:02.408 --> 04:04.577
[pensive music]

04:05.620 --> 04:07.413
[Ji-ung] Don't get fooled
by words like that.

04:11.167 --> 04:13.002
Just go and apologize.

04:13.086 --> 04:15.755
Oh, yeah, have you tried
that new teokbokki place?

04:15.838 --> 04:17.131
- It seems good.
- Okay. I'm hungry.

04:17.215 --> 04:18.883
[Ji-ung] I tried meeting new people.

04:18.967 --> 04:20.718
- I see. Cool.
- Let's go try it?

04:20.802 --> 04:22.929
[pensive music]

04:26.557 --> 04:28.893
[sighs deeply]

04:28.977 --> 04:31.896
This time,
it looks like it's over for real.

04:32.772 --> 04:35.275
[breathes heavily]

04:41.155 --> 04:42.323
[sighs]

04:43.574 --> 04:45.576
KOOK YEON-SU

04:45.660 --> 04:47.036
DELETE, SYNC CONTACT, SHARE CONTACT

04:49.998 --> 04:53.543
[Ji-ung] And whatever happens,
don't you ever dare waver.

04:55.044 --> 04:56.129
Yeon-su!

04:56.921 --> 04:58.339
- [Ji-ung] And…
- [Yeon-su] Oh, hey!

05:03.928 --> 05:05.930
…you have to slowly forget her.

05:10.226 --> 05:14.147
But then, just when I had thought
my plans had succeeded…

05:14.897 --> 05:17.275
How have you been doing, Kim Ji-ung?

05:18.651 --> 05:20.611
[Ji-ung] …Yeon-su is
standing in front of me again.

05:21.404 --> 05:23.573
[light music]

05:26.117 --> 05:27.827
Like a risk factor out of my control.

05:29.245 --> 05:30.455
Just like now.

05:30.955 --> 05:32.915
[rain pattering]

05:32.999 --> 05:34.167
But then…

05:35.209 --> 05:37.628
now I actually find myself thinking,

05:38.212 --> 05:40.173
if things don't go
according to plan again,

05:41.507 --> 05:45.219
do I really need plans now?
Or do I just let it be?

05:45.303 --> 05:48.681
EPISODE 9
JUST FRIENDS

05:51.642 --> 05:53.019
[music fades]

06:00.985 --> 06:02.528
[huffs]

06:07.575 --> 06:09.786
[insects chirping]

06:09.869 --> 06:11.079
[groans]

06:15.208 --> 06:16.334
[switch clicks]

06:18.586 --> 06:19.587
[sighs]

06:23.299 --> 06:24.759
[groans]

06:25.718 --> 06:27.553
[slippers rasping]

06:29.472 --> 06:30.473
[switch clicks]

06:31.974 --> 06:32.975
[rasps]

06:34.310 --> 06:35.478
[sighs]

06:38.564 --> 06:39.732
[sighs]

06:40.900 --> 06:43.778
["Summer Rain" by Sam Kim playing]

06:55.957 --> 06:57.875
[sighs heavily]

07:09.345 --> 07:11.389
["Summer Rain" by Sam Kim continues]

07:22.775 --> 07:24.861
[sighs sharply]

07:28.448 --> 07:29.615
[groans]

07:37.165 --> 07:39.000
[groaning sigh]

07:43.921 --> 07:45.006
[sighs]

07:49.135 --> 07:51.429
["Summer Rain" by Sam Kim playing]

08:02.773 --> 08:04.942
[coughing]

08:10.781 --> 08:12.617
[sighs heavily]

08:14.035 --> 08:14.911
[groans]

08:16.829 --> 08:18.915
[coughing]

08:28.466 --> 08:30.051
- [mug thuds]
- [coughs]

08:32.845 --> 08:34.597
[birds chirping]

08:36.807 --> 08:40.061
["Summer Rain" by Sam Kim continues]

08:49.320 --> 08:51.239
[deep sigh]

08:51.322 --> 08:54.116
Ung! I called you so many times!

08:55.326 --> 08:56.536
Are you still sleeping?

08:59.247 --> 09:00.248
Ung.

09:01.082 --> 09:02.208
Ung?

09:05.127 --> 09:06.379
Hey, are you okay?

09:09.340 --> 09:10.633
Oh, gosh.

09:10.716 --> 09:12.468
Hey. Get up.
[groans]

09:12.552 --> 09:14.303
Dude, you're burning up!

09:14.387 --> 09:15.638
Are you okay?

09:16.597 --> 09:19.433
["Summer Rain" continues]

09:36.450 --> 09:38.077
[water sloshing]

09:39.495 --> 09:41.539
BEST PROPOSAL
CULTURE-COMPLEX, BEAUTY, FASHION

09:41.622 --> 09:43.374
Thanks to our past projects,

09:43.457 --> 09:47.169
we have a lot of marketing requests
for cultural-complex centers.

09:48.462 --> 09:50.923
The ones we can work on now involve us…

09:52.341 --> 09:53.968
Ms. Kook?

09:56.095 --> 09:57.763
- Ms. Kook!
- [gasps]

09:58.973 --> 10:00.224
- Oh, right.
- [sighs]

10:01.350 --> 10:03.311
- Are you feeling okay?
- [awkward chuckle]

10:03.394 --> 10:05.229
Are you really not feeling well today?

10:05.313 --> 10:07.440
You look a bit pale, to be honest.

10:07.523 --> 10:09.150
You should have gotten
more rest, you know.

10:09.233 --> 10:10.693
Are you really okay?

10:10.776 --> 10:13.613
I'm really sorry.
Can we take a short break?

10:14.780 --> 10:15.865
Okay.

10:20.244 --> 10:22.622
[sighs]
She's been acting like that for days.

10:22.705 --> 10:23.831
It's been five days.

10:24.498 --> 10:27.960
She's been out of it ever since
she came back from her leave a week ago.

10:28.044 --> 10:29.670
Do you think something happened to her?

10:30.963 --> 10:32.214
[Yeon-su sighs]

10:32.882 --> 10:35.134
What's going on with me?

10:35.217 --> 10:37.136
[humming]

10:38.137 --> 10:39.013
[sighs]

10:47.772 --> 10:49.815
This is going way to far already.

10:52.777 --> 10:53.861
[groans]

10:55.196 --> 10:56.656
[phone buzzing]

10:57.448 --> 10:58.532
SOL-I

10:58.616 --> 11:00.868
- [phone buzzing]
- [sighs]

11:03.788 --> 11:04.955
- Yeah?
- [Sol-i] "Yeah"?

11:05.039 --> 11:07.166
What is this? You answered right away.

11:07.750 --> 11:09.043
[Yeon-su] Hey, what's up?

11:09.126 --> 11:10.503
I want you to come over after work.

11:10.586 --> 11:11.837
I have a new menu prepared.

11:11.921 --> 11:13.756
Next time. I'm busy.

11:13.839 --> 11:16.884
You're busy again?
You just finished your last project.

11:16.967 --> 11:18.427
I need to test out my menu.

11:18.511 --> 11:20.012
Just call someone else.

11:23.641 --> 11:26.394
Why don't you try calling Gu Eun-ho?

11:27.019 --> 11:28.187
He's trying it right now.

11:28.813 --> 11:31.023
But then he's saying
that everything's bad.

11:31.107 --> 11:32.608
I don't think I can trust him.

11:32.691 --> 11:33.776
What?

11:33.859 --> 11:35.820
He's at your place? He's not at work?

11:35.903 --> 11:37.071
He has time off?

11:37.738 --> 11:40.282
- Hey, are you free?
- Hmm.

11:40.366 --> 11:42.576
Why are you always free?
Don't you have work?

11:42.660 --> 11:44.745
[hums, chomps]

11:45.913 --> 11:48.040
That settles it. He's unemployed.

11:48.124 --> 11:50.584
[Sol-i] He's resting
since Ung's taking a break.

11:50.668 --> 11:51.877
What does that mean?

11:51.961 --> 11:54.672
Anyway, just come over later.
Stop acting busy.

11:54.755 --> 11:55.631
[phone chimes]

12:00.302 --> 12:03.639
[Yeon-su] I can't help but wonder
what Ung is thinking about now.

12:08.686 --> 12:11.522
[gentle music]

12:11.605 --> 12:14.108
[crying]

12:18.070 --> 12:20.197
[crying continues]

12:27.663 --> 12:30.332
[heavy breathing]

12:31.292 --> 12:33.294
[somber music]

12:35.212 --> 12:36.422
[breathes heavily]

12:37.965 --> 12:40.384
[sighs deeply]

12:43.679 --> 12:44.930
[groans]

12:46.056 --> 12:47.099
[clears throat]

12:58.444 --> 12:59.653
[groans]

12:59.737 --> 13:01.071
[blinds whirring]

13:04.742 --> 13:06.911
- [whirring continues]
- [groans]

13:11.457 --> 13:12.791
[sighs]

13:12.875 --> 13:14.543
How long have I been like this?

13:17.129 --> 13:18.464
[sighs]

13:22.343 --> 13:23.594
[exhales]

13:33.521 --> 13:34.605
[Ung] Hey, Mom.

13:54.166 --> 13:55.918
- Mom?
- [gasps]

13:56.001 --> 13:57.127
Oh, you're up.

13:57.211 --> 14:00.047
Come over here.
Let me see if your fever broke.

14:00.130 --> 14:01.423
[both sigh]

14:03.008 --> 14:04.593
- [Ung groaning]
- [grunts]

14:06.428 --> 14:08.556
Oh. Your fever's all gone.

14:09.139 --> 14:12.643
Sometimes you get a bad fever
whenever you caught a cold.

14:13.561 --> 14:16.522
Are you still taking the meds
I sent over to you last time?

14:16.605 --> 14:18.357
- Hmm.
- [Yeon-ok] Mm-hm.

14:18.440 --> 14:20.276
You only took a few and stopped, huh?

14:20.359 --> 14:23.445
I heard you got drenched in the rain
during your trip for the shoot.

14:24.280 --> 14:25.197
[sighs]

14:25.281 --> 14:27.616
One of these days
I'm gonna get rid of Eun-ho.

14:27.700 --> 14:29.535
[chuckles softly]

14:34.832 --> 14:36.333
But what are you doing here, Mom?

14:36.417 --> 14:39.670
You know, I think it's the first time
I've seen your drawings

14:39.753 --> 14:41.672
up close like this.

14:42.840 --> 14:45.342
You left early last time
without looking at it.

14:46.468 --> 14:47.928
[deep sigh]

14:49.638 --> 14:53.934
When did my little boy
grow up so much? You're all grown up.

14:55.352 --> 14:56.395
Wait, what?

14:57.813 --> 15:00.107
Mom, I've been a grown man for a while.

15:00.190 --> 15:02.234
[Yeon-ok chuckles]

15:02.318 --> 15:03.569
[inhales]

15:04.486 --> 15:06.947
Why did you grow up all alone?

15:09.241 --> 15:11.619
[Yeon-ok] Did you have a hard time so far?

15:13.412 --> 15:16.498
You shouldn't have to carry
the load all on your own.

15:16.582 --> 15:19.335
You really don't.
[inhales deeply]

15:20.210 --> 15:23.464
Well, then I guess Mom and Dad

15:23.547 --> 15:26.133
aren't those you can always depend on.

15:26.717 --> 15:28.677
It's not that, don't worry, Mom.

15:29.428 --> 15:31.889
I'm just comfortable spending time alone.

15:32.890 --> 15:35.601
Ung, but still…

15:35.684 --> 15:38.395
It's okay. I like how I am.

15:38.479 --> 15:40.564
[soft music]

15:42.441 --> 15:44.777
[Ung] It's okay
to be alone for a long time.

15:44.860 --> 15:46.153
You get used to it.

15:47.988 --> 15:49.823
But I never want to be alone again

15:51.408 --> 15:53.369
after losing someone important.

15:56.580 --> 15:58.749
[soft music continues]

16:02.878 --> 16:04.546
- [music fades]
- [groans]

16:05.756 --> 16:08.133
We just had instant noodles
for lunch the first day.

16:08.217 --> 16:11.220
And then later we grilled up some meat
and even made stew for dinner.

16:11.303 --> 16:13.305
One of them was a really good cook too.

16:13.973 --> 16:15.307
And then on the next day…

16:16.725 --> 16:18.852
Uh… what did we have again?

16:20.145 --> 16:23.065
Oh, the cast slept in, so the rest of us
went out to eat that morning.

16:23.148 --> 16:24.233
And then later on for lunch--

16:24.316 --> 16:27.861
Hey, I wasn't asking what you ate there.
You got it?

16:27.945 --> 16:29.071
Oh.

16:30.823 --> 16:33.075
Ji-ung was the one
who filmed Ms. Kook on the first day,

16:33.158 --> 16:35.369
and Chae-ran handled filmed for Mr. Choi.

16:35.452 --> 16:37.496
Meanwhile, I stayed back
and set up the lights.

16:37.579 --> 16:39.707
And then we filmed at the house
in the evening too.

16:39.790 --> 16:41.291
- And then the next--
- No, not that.

16:41.375 --> 16:44.378
Tell me, di… didn't
anything interesting happen?

16:45.879 --> 16:48.632
Oh, right.
The casts' friends were really fun.

16:48.716 --> 16:51.427
[Tae-hun] During the shoot,
they showed me all around the village.

16:51.510 --> 16:52.970
[chuckles]

16:53.053 --> 16:55.180
Hey. Go.

16:55.264 --> 16:56.473
Go on, drink.

16:56.557 --> 16:57.725
Shut up and drink.

16:59.143 --> 17:00.853
[sighs]
Jeez.

17:04.314 --> 17:06.400
Oh, right.

17:06.984 --> 17:08.736
There was a lot of rain
on one of the days,

17:08.819 --> 17:11.196
so we were kind of forced
to stop filming that day.

17:11.947 --> 17:12.781
And?

17:12.865 --> 17:15.075
Chae-ran was filming
with Ms. Kook during that time,

17:15.159 --> 17:17.244
but she came back alone.

17:17.327 --> 17:20.289
And then Ji-ung arrived
with Ms. Kook a little while later.

17:21.081 --> 17:23.584
[Tae-hun] And then Mr. Choi
was gone for a long time too,

17:23.667 --> 17:25.919
but then he came back soaking wet after.

17:26.754 --> 17:28.047
Really?

17:28.130 --> 17:30.299
Oh… Then what?

17:30.382 --> 17:32.426
- And so we canceled the shoot.
- [soft gasp]

17:32.509 --> 17:34.219
We were going to film more the next day,

17:34.303 --> 17:37.222
but we couldn't because the cast went
to Seoul instead early in the morning.

17:37.306 --> 17:38.432
Oh…

17:39.850 --> 17:41.935
Then why didn't you tell me earlier?

17:42.019 --> 17:44.688
You should have told me
when I asked if anything happened then!

17:44.772 --> 17:45.689
[groans]

17:46.857 --> 17:49.735
- But then, why did the cast leave early?
- [inhales]

17:49.818 --> 17:52.905
Well, they said there was
something urgent they had to do.

17:53.447 --> 17:55.574
But it was kind of… how do I say…

17:55.657 --> 17:57.868
It did seem like something was going on.

17:57.951 --> 17:59.995
The cast could have fought, maybe.

18:00.079 --> 18:03.332
No. But it seemed like something
different was going on with them.

18:04.041 --> 18:05.667
But what's even more strange

18:05.751 --> 18:08.337
was that Ji-ung and Chae-ran
were acting weird too.

18:08.420 --> 18:09.880
[Tae-hun] They were quiet.

18:09.963 --> 18:12.299
- Why?
- Uh, why? Well…

18:12.382 --> 18:14.718
I'm not really sure why they were.

18:14.802 --> 18:19.181
But they were talking outside
for a long time and late at night too.

18:19.264 --> 18:22.101
- Really? Private?
- [exclaims]

18:22.893 --> 18:25.854
Oh, really? Well, is that so?

18:25.938 --> 18:27.940
[quirky music]

18:29.608 --> 18:30.692
[exhales]

18:31.360 --> 18:34.196
- [keys clicking]
- [mouse clicking]

18:39.451 --> 18:40.661
[sighs]

18:40.744 --> 18:42.746
[exhausted groan]

18:45.916 --> 18:47.835
[Chae-ran] Ji-ung,
I ordered you some dinner.

18:48.669 --> 18:49.711
Come and eat it later.

18:54.591 --> 18:55.843
[sighs]

19:01.515 --> 19:02.724
[Ji-ung] Did you get off work?

19:05.561 --> 19:06.937
Have you eaten dinner?

19:07.020 --> 19:09.022
[soft music]

19:11.275 --> 19:12.359
[sighs]

19:13.277 --> 19:14.945
Did you rest…
[clicks tongue]

19:17.573 --> 19:18.532
[sighs]

19:18.615 --> 19:20.117
I want to make it seem like

19:21.451 --> 19:22.870
nothing's going on, but…

19:25.873 --> 19:28.542
[soft music continues]

19:33.505 --> 19:34.631
[phone buzzing]

19:39.595 --> 19:41.972
KIM JI-UNG

19:48.353 --> 19:49.605
[sighs]

19:52.399 --> 19:53.650
[phone buzzing]

19:56.737 --> 19:58.697
[Yeon-su] Where are you?
Text me the address.

19:58.780 --> 20:00.199
[Ji-ung] Are you coming for me?

20:00.282 --> 20:02.743
[Yeon-su] I can find you easily.
Delete it while I'm asking nicely.

20:02.826 --> 20:04.453
[Ji-ung] I'm the one who decides.

20:04.536 --> 20:07.706
[Yeon-su] Only if you're still alive then.
Delete it.

20:07.789 --> 20:09.917
[Ji-ung chuckling]
You make that face all the time anyway.

20:10.000 --> 20:11.210
That's your limit.

20:12.711 --> 20:14.588
[Yeon-su] That's the limit
of the producer.

20:17.382 --> 20:19.968
LEEZAKAYA

20:20.761 --> 20:22.888
[Ji-ung] All right, I'll delete it.

20:22.971 --> 20:24.139
Did you have dinner yet?

20:25.307 --> 20:27.434
[soft gentle music]

20:30.312 --> 20:32.856
[deep breath]

20:43.408 --> 20:45.577
[gentle music continues]

20:48.163 --> 20:49.623
[deep inhale]

20:49.706 --> 20:51.124
[sighs]

20:51.208 --> 20:52.251
WITH UNG

20:53.126 --> 20:54.795
- Oh, you're back.
- Hey.

20:54.878 --> 20:56.630
How is he? Has his fever gone down?

20:56.713 --> 20:58.131
Yes.
[sighs]

20:58.215 --> 21:01.593
His fever's down,
and I gave him some food.

21:06.390 --> 21:08.433
- But why do you look so down?
- What?

21:08.517 --> 21:11.645
- Is he still not feeling that well yet?
- It's not that.

21:11.728 --> 21:13.772
I looked around his studio,

21:14.314 --> 21:16.566
and he had a lot more pills than before.

21:16.650 --> 21:18.527
He still seems to have trouble sleeping.

21:19.444 --> 21:21.613
He must be spending
all of his time in there.

21:22.322 --> 21:25.242
And when I went
and looked around his room.

21:25.325 --> 21:28.120
I couldn't help but feel
how lonely it was there.

21:28.203 --> 21:29.871
- Really?
- Hmm.

21:31.498 --> 21:35.627
You think…
that Ung will be okay like this?

21:38.171 --> 21:40.257
You know, he's not like others.

21:40.340 --> 21:43.093
I'm sure that he'll be all right, huh?

21:51.977 --> 21:53.020
[sighs]

21:53.854 --> 21:55.230
UNG'S DRAWINGS ORGANIZED BY EUN-HO

22:14.750 --> 22:15.959
[groans]

22:22.799 --> 22:24.926
[light music]

22:35.312 --> 22:37.647
[light music continues]

22:40.442 --> 22:41.526
[scrapes]

22:42.277 --> 22:43.779
DRAWINGS FROM UNG'S DARK TIMES

22:45.947 --> 22:48.492
[Eun-ho] I appreciate
your drawing skills, of course,

22:48.575 --> 22:51.244
but I really hope
this period never comes back.

22:53.997 --> 22:56.124
[light vulnerable music]

23:10.806 --> 23:12.933
[light music continues]

23:29.199 --> 23:30.784
[squelching]

23:32.202 --> 23:34.830
- [Sol-i] Did you sleep with him?
- Are you crazy?

23:35.831 --> 23:38.667
So then all you two did was kiss, right?

23:38.750 --> 23:41.336
And you're ruining
my new dish just because of that?

23:41.419 --> 23:42.420
"All we did was kiss"?

23:42.504 --> 23:45.340
Is that why you two ran away
the next day all of a sudden?

23:46.049 --> 23:48.009
Oh! So boring!
[exclaims]

23:48.093 --> 23:50.303
Isn't there anything interesting?

23:50.387 --> 23:51.471
[sighs]

23:52.139 --> 23:55.517
Honestly speaking, it's more surprising
that nothing has happened until now.

23:56.101 --> 23:58.854
If the same thing happened with my ex,
it'd be different.

23:58.937 --> 24:02.107
I'd have loads of feelings left,
you know I'd be a sentimental mess,

24:02.190 --> 24:04.776
and then next thing you know,
I'd be drinking and jumping all over him.

24:04.860 --> 24:06.611
I really must be crazy, huh?

24:06.695 --> 24:08.655
To come to your place
and tell you all this.

24:08.738 --> 24:10.824
Hey, now, you two are adults, aren't you?

24:10.907 --> 24:12.784
Plus, you guys have dated before.

24:12.868 --> 24:16.413
Things like that can happen,
especially if the mood is right.

24:16.496 --> 24:18.373
Everyone does that. What's the problem?

24:18.456 --> 24:20.250
But not everyone is like you.

24:20.333 --> 24:22.127
Well, not everyone's like you, either.

24:24.379 --> 24:28.717
Just say, "It was a mistake,"
and then forget about it.

24:28.800 --> 24:30.510
But it's really not that simple.

24:31.136 --> 24:34.431
Listen to yourself, you're just
making things more complicated.

24:35.265 --> 24:38.435
And why in the world are you being
so pouty about this whole thing?

24:38.518 --> 24:39.728
[Sol-i] What's the problem?

24:39.811 --> 24:42.230
I mean, he hasn't even bothered
to try and contact me.

24:42.314 --> 24:44.316
- [sighs]
- Even after he did something like that?

24:44.983 --> 24:47.903
Hey, then what are your fingers for, huh?

24:47.986 --> 24:49.196
Call him up.

24:51.907 --> 24:54.492
Or maybe he's gotten his answer already.

24:54.576 --> 24:58.121
He's decided, "It was a mistake."
Is that what you think?

24:58.997 --> 25:00.665
He's not the type to do that.

25:00.749 --> 25:02.250
[Sol-i] What are you on about?

25:02.334 --> 25:04.169
Do you still think he's your boyfriend?

25:04.252 --> 25:06.880
Hey, you don't know him now.

25:06.963 --> 25:08.882
He might seem dim-witted on the outside,

25:08.965 --> 25:11.134
but he's actually much more
thoughtful than I am.

25:11.218 --> 25:14.054
Oh, jeez. Don't you get it?

25:14.137 --> 25:16.848
If he wanted to get back together,
he would have come to you already.

25:16.932 --> 25:18.225
But where is he now…

25:30.487 --> 25:31.488
Do you…

25:35.784 --> 25:37.452
want to get back together? Is that it?

25:45.293 --> 25:47.420
Are you really worried
that he might say that?

25:48.588 --> 25:50.048
It was a mistake?

25:54.219 --> 25:55.595
Or do you still…

26:02.352 --> 26:03.728
[Sol-i sighs]

26:04.729 --> 26:05.814
Yeon-su.

26:09.109 --> 26:10.402
When did this feeling start?

26:14.531 --> 26:15.824
Was it from the beginning?

26:17.534 --> 26:19.536
[gentle vulnerable music]

26:21.913 --> 26:24.374
[Yeon-su] Even when I had to return
to this relationship

26:26.501 --> 26:28.253
that I had coldly abandoned…

26:29.879 --> 26:30.839
Who…

26:32.590 --> 26:33.842
[Yeon-su] …I was so confident.

26:38.638 --> 26:40.932
["There For You" by Kim Na Young playing]

26:44.853 --> 26:47.022
I just had to avoid any emotions.

26:48.898 --> 26:50.317
How have you been?

26:53.320 --> 26:54.321
Answer me.

26:56.197 --> 26:57.741
How have you been, Yeon-su?

26:59.451 --> 27:01.870
[Yeon-su] So I just
had to hide my feelings.

27:02.871 --> 27:04.914
[rain clattering]

27:06.249 --> 27:08.626
["There For You" by Kim Na Young
continues]

27:16.885 --> 27:17.886
But then…

27:19.554 --> 27:20.680
[sniffles]

27:22.974 --> 27:24.809
What do I do, Sol-i?

27:28.605 --> 27:30.315
I'm not that sure anymore.

27:33.234 --> 27:34.652
[deep shaky exhale]

27:48.458 --> 27:50.752
["There For You" by Kim Na Young playing]

28:09.729 --> 28:11.106
[music fades]

28:14.401 --> 28:15.610
[chuckles]

28:16.277 --> 28:18.905
[Yeon-su] Yes.
I'm eating something disgusting.

28:18.988 --> 28:19.906
[door opens]

28:26.413 --> 28:29.040
Why are you just standing there
with the lights off?

28:32.460 --> 28:34.087
Your room is squeaky clean too.

28:35.296 --> 28:37.340
At least you seem to be cleaning properly.

28:38.716 --> 28:41.094
[pensive music]

28:43.513 --> 28:45.557
I'm going to be staying here for a while.

28:47.559 --> 28:48.852
[Ji-ung] Do whatever you want.

28:48.935 --> 28:50.395
Just like you always did.

28:50.979 --> 28:52.063
[inhales]

28:54.482 --> 28:55.650
[sighs]

28:57.944 --> 29:00.113
[pensive music continues]

29:00.196 --> 29:01.698
[sighs]

29:04.451 --> 29:06.369
[Ji-ung] I was in such a good mood today.

29:11.374 --> 29:12.292
[Sol-i] Please enjoy.

29:12.375 --> 29:13.418
Thank you.

29:14.169 --> 29:15.712
[man] We should come here more often.

29:16.254 --> 29:18.173
[indistinct chatter]

29:25.680 --> 29:26.765
Holy shit!

29:28.183 --> 29:29.809
Oh, this is a disaster.

29:31.728 --> 29:33.521
[Sol-i sighs]

29:34.606 --> 29:36.858
[dramatic music]

29:38.735 --> 29:40.820
[Ung] I'm done with thinking.

29:42.864 --> 29:44.616
There's only one conclusion.

29:50.121 --> 29:51.122
[dial tone]

29:52.874 --> 29:54.209
[knocking on door]

29:56.169 --> 29:58.755
[dramatic music rises]

30:08.223 --> 30:09.641
Hey! Wait!

30:14.938 --> 30:16.022
Kook Yeon-su.

30:18.691 --> 30:19.818
[sighs]

30:21.110 --> 30:22.278
Wait, are you drunk right now?

30:24.197 --> 30:25.824
[Yeon-su sighs]

30:25.907 --> 30:28.201
- Are you a douchebag?
- What?

30:28.785 --> 30:32.080
[chuckles]
You've really changed, haven't you?

30:32.789 --> 30:34.833
I don't care how you've lived so far

30:34.916 --> 30:37.627
or how much freedom you've enjoyed
since the last time we were together,

30:37.710 --> 30:39.420
but were you really going to…

30:40.547 --> 30:43.466
- Going to…
- Do you want some water?

30:45.093 --> 30:47.178
[Yeon-su breathing heavily]

30:48.221 --> 30:50.390
Were you really going
to just stay here and pretend

30:50.473 --> 30:52.934
like nothing happened
after doing all that to me?

30:53.017 --> 30:56.229
[Yeon-su] Is that what people do now?
Is that what they would do…

30:56.312 --> 30:58.648
Do they just kiss
or hold hands with anyone

30:58.731 --> 30:59.941
and then ghost them?

31:00.984 --> 31:02.235
You don't have to shout, you know.

31:02.318 --> 31:04.445
When did that become the cool thing to do?

31:04.529 --> 31:06.322
That's just being a douchebag.

31:07.365 --> 31:09.534
[Yeon-su sighs]

31:15.206 --> 31:16.457
[exhales]

31:23.840 --> 31:25.008
Are you done yet?

31:31.139 --> 31:32.724
[sighs]

31:36.519 --> 31:39.063
How are you acting
like nothing happened between us?

31:41.941 --> 31:45.904
Do you really have nothing to say,
even though I'm standing right here?

31:49.532 --> 31:50.950
You really don't?

31:53.953 --> 31:55.204
Should I apologize…

31:56.873 --> 31:58.333
say it was a mistake?

31:59.375 --> 32:00.418
What?

32:02.045 --> 32:03.254
Is that what you want?

32:10.678 --> 32:11.971
Because I don't want to.

32:14.766 --> 32:15.808
Then what?

32:16.517 --> 32:18.311
Then what do you want to do now?

32:26.152 --> 32:27.612
I'm not dating you again.

32:32.241 --> 32:35.036
[Ung] So this is the only conclusion.

32:38.331 --> 32:39.540
Oh.

32:41.876 --> 32:46.255
So you don't want to say that it…
that it was a mistake or apologize to me

32:48.091 --> 32:49.968
or even start dating again.

32:51.803 --> 32:54.722
So you're just telling me
to get lost, is that it?

32:56.766 --> 32:58.101
[Yeon-su scoffs]

32:58.184 --> 33:01.229
You should have said so earlier
and not wasted my time.

33:03.523 --> 33:04.857
[Ung] In spite of all of that…

33:05.817 --> 33:08.361
I've concluded that
I can't live without seeing her.

33:08.444 --> 33:09.529
- Yeon-su.
- [Yeon-su] Don't call me.

33:09.612 --> 33:12.073
I'm never going to
see you again, you inconsiderate jerk.

33:12.156 --> 33:13.449
Can we still be friends?

33:15.243 --> 33:18.246
[gentle music]

33:30.299 --> 33:31.676
Let's be friends instead.

33:34.345 --> 33:35.304
What was that?

33:38.141 --> 33:39.559
You want to be what?

33:40.226 --> 33:41.227
Friends.

33:41.894 --> 33:42.729
Why?

33:43.980 --> 33:46.441
We've never been friends before, have we?

33:47.608 --> 33:48.526
[sighs]

33:50.445 --> 33:53.197
[gentle music continues]

33:54.866 --> 33:56.242
I mean, who knows?

33:56.325 --> 33:59.203
We could be
the best of friends instead, right?

33:59.996 --> 34:01.372
Are you drunk right now?

34:01.456 --> 34:03.291
You're the one who's drunk.

34:03.374 --> 34:04.792
You're not on drugs, are you?

34:04.876 --> 34:07.086
I'm not. I'll take my meds later.

34:09.964 --> 34:12.175
Can you really be friends with me?

34:14.761 --> 34:16.054
Hmm.

34:19.140 --> 34:20.183
[inhales]

34:22.977 --> 34:25.188
[gentle music]

34:26.481 --> 34:27.815
[sighs]

34:29.358 --> 34:30.401
Okay.

34:31.819 --> 34:33.196
So let's just be friends, then.

34:35.615 --> 34:36.991
That should be fun, I guess.

34:38.451 --> 34:40.661
[gentle music continues]

34:45.124 --> 34:46.584
[deep sigh]

34:49.670 --> 34:51.422
Do you have anything else that…

34:51.923 --> 34:53.549
[gasps]

34:54.842 --> 34:56.177
Can I sleep over tonight?

34:57.053 --> 34:58.262
Uh, what?

34:58.346 --> 35:01.265
If we're friends, it's okay, right?

35:10.191 --> 35:11.484
[sighs]

35:20.118 --> 35:21.619
[chuckles in disbelief]

35:25.123 --> 35:26.415
[groaning sigh]

35:30.336 --> 35:32.171
Is this because you're drunk?

35:32.797 --> 35:35.174
I'm doing this because we're friends.

35:35.258 --> 35:37.218
- Hey.
- Where's your blanket?

35:37.301 --> 35:39.887
You're not making a friend
sleep without a blanket, are you?

35:39.971 --> 35:41.055
Kook Yeon-su!

35:41.139 --> 35:43.266
Oh, calm down. You don't have to shout.

35:43.349 --> 35:44.308
[groans]

35:45.017 --> 35:47.395
As you can see,
I drank a bit more than I could handle,

35:47.478 --> 35:50.523
so I'm really tired now.
Would you mind being a bit more quiet?

35:50.606 --> 35:52.984
Hey, why don't you just
go sleep on the bed then.

35:53.067 --> 35:54.819
I'll be working downstairs anyway.

35:54.902 --> 35:58.072
Don't be ridiculous.
Just treat me like a friend, okay?

35:58.156 --> 36:00.116
And give me a blanket before you go.

36:00.199 --> 36:01.284
[scoffs]

36:07.874 --> 36:08.708
[switch clicks]

36:22.889 --> 36:26.767
["The Giving Tree"
by Lee Seung Yoon playing]

36:28.895 --> 36:29.979
[sighs]

36:43.284 --> 36:45.620
["The Giving Tree"
by Lee Seung Yoon continues]

36:46.495 --> 36:47.705
[sighs]

36:53.169 --> 36:54.003
[scoffs]

36:55.213 --> 36:57.173
What does she think she's doing?

36:57.256 --> 36:58.799
[phone buzzing]

37:00.259 --> 37:01.677
KIM JI-UNG

37:13.397 --> 37:15.191
[system] The person you're calling
is unavailable…

37:20.154 --> 37:21.656
[sighs deeply]

37:26.577 --> 37:28.955
["The Giving Tree" continues]

37:48.516 --> 37:49.850
[deep sigh]

38:07.910 --> 38:09.245
[exhales]

38:13.499 --> 38:14.750
[music fades]

38:26.554 --> 38:28.055
[sighs deeply]

38:34.854 --> 38:36.272
[water trickles]

38:42.111 --> 38:43.279
[spits loudly]

38:44.405 --> 38:45.823
That was enthusiastic.

38:45.906 --> 38:48.200
Hey! What are you still doing in my house?

38:48.284 --> 38:50.161
I took a shower.
Oh, can I borrow your clothes?

38:50.244 --> 38:51.495
I didn't bring anything when I came here.

38:52.079 --> 38:53.622
He… hey, then just go home already.

38:53.706 --> 38:56.000
- Why? Can't I hang out here?
- Why?

38:56.083 --> 38:59.253
Because I want to hang out with my friend.
Got a problem with that?

38:59.337 --> 39:01.505
Hey. Why are you even doing this?

39:01.589 --> 39:02.923
You know I don't have any friends.

39:03.007 --> 39:04.967
So I'm excited
'cause I just got a new friend

39:05.051 --> 39:06.385
for the first time in 29 years.

39:06.469 --> 39:09.764
Oh, yeah, if you decide you want to
stop being friends, let me know, hm?

39:11.223 --> 39:12.892
- [water pours]
- [bottle thuds]

39:15.686 --> 39:17.730
I'll just take some clothes
from your closet.

39:17.813 --> 39:20.066
Didn't you sleep?
Isn't it time for bed now?

39:20.149 --> 39:21.025
I'm going to sleep.

39:21.108 --> 39:23.486
Go to bed. I'll just hang out here, okay?

39:23.569 --> 39:25.321
[clears throat awkwardly]

39:25.404 --> 39:28.282
I hope you're not here anymore
by the time I wake up later.

39:28.366 --> 39:31.285
I'll be the one to decide that.
Get some sleep.

39:31.369 --> 39:32.620
[sighs in disbelief]

39:32.703 --> 39:34.789
[quirky music]

39:35.998 --> 39:36.916
[sighs]

39:36.999 --> 39:38.959
Jeez, what the hell is wrong
with that woman?

39:42.588 --> 39:43.422
Hmm?

39:46.759 --> 39:48.511
How did she know I hadn't slept yet?

39:56.852 --> 39:58.604
[groans]

40:00.856 --> 40:02.942
[reporters chatting]

40:03.025 --> 40:05.027
[uplifting music]

40:06.612 --> 40:09.365
INCHEON AIRPORT

40:14.412 --> 40:16.997
Hey, good job. Did you sleep on the plane?

40:18.582 --> 40:21.127
Chi-seong, what day is it today?

40:21.210 --> 40:23.754
- It's Sunday, right?
- It's Saturday.

40:23.838 --> 40:25.923
Seriously? It isn't Sunday yet?

40:26.006 --> 40:28.634
What are you going to do on Sunday?
Why do you keep asking me that?

40:28.717 --> 40:31.095
My schedule's empty on Sunday, isn't it?

40:31.178 --> 40:33.139
Yeah, it's just as I said.

40:33.222 --> 40:34.265
[soft chuckle]

40:34.348 --> 40:37.393
- I'm going on a date.
- You mean…

40:37.476 --> 40:39.353
- The artist?
- Hmm.

40:39.437 --> 40:41.647
Are you really sure that it's a date?

40:42.606 --> 40:45.443
If a man and a woman meet alone,
it's a date.

40:45.526 --> 40:47.570
And we set up a date properly this time.

40:47.653 --> 40:48.737
[sighs]

40:48.821 --> 40:51.365
All right. Just please
don't cause any trouble.

40:52.032 --> 40:53.075
And take care too.

40:53.159 --> 40:56.203
I'm not causing any trouble these days.
Don't worry about it.

41:00.082 --> 41:02.084
No, wait, he's probably sleeping now.

41:02.668 --> 41:04.503
- I'll just call later.
- Wait a sec.

41:05.546 --> 41:09.258
Were you really just being considerate
to another person right now?

41:11.552 --> 41:13.512
Oh, you're right.

41:14.388 --> 41:16.557
I didn't know I could actually do that.

41:17.099 --> 41:18.934
Looks like I've changed.

41:23.731 --> 41:24.773
[door closes]

41:28.819 --> 41:30.154
Have some food.

41:32.823 --> 41:34.074
Hey, Ung.

41:34.158 --> 41:36.952
[soft music]

41:37.036 --> 41:39.997
How can your repertoire
be exactly the same every time?

41:40.664 --> 41:42.374
[Ji-ung] That's honestly incredible.

41:42.458 --> 41:44.168
- [sighs]
- [cutlery clinking]

41:45.169 --> 41:47.213
At least have one bite first.

41:48.380 --> 41:49.798
We can always talk while you eat.

41:50.841 --> 41:53.427
You always come and go
whenever you please.

41:53.511 --> 41:57.348
You don't have to try to act
like a mother to me, you know?

42:00.809 --> 42:01.852
[scoffs softly]

42:05.773 --> 42:07.107
[music fades]

42:15.324 --> 42:17.284
[groans]

42:20.246 --> 42:21.372
[sighs]

42:24.667 --> 42:26.126
[groans]

42:40.724 --> 42:42.518
What are you still doing here?

42:42.601 --> 42:43.852
Hey, you're finally up.

42:46.021 --> 42:47.648
You didn't sleep that much, you know.

42:47.731 --> 42:49.525
You'll die early at this rate.

42:49.608 --> 42:50.859
Hey, that shirt…

42:51.569 --> 42:54.280
Oh, I just took it
from your closet, that's all.

42:54.363 --> 42:56.156
I see you didn't throw it away.

42:56.991 --> 42:58.325
I didn't even know it was there.

42:58.409 --> 43:00.995
Oh, really? It was folded up
nice and neat, though.

43:01.579 --> 43:02.454
Oh.

43:02.538 --> 43:06.500
Do you feel awkward that I'm wearing
our couple shirt when we're friends now?

43:06.584 --> 43:08.168
- Should I go change?
- [huffs]

43:08.252 --> 43:09.837
Not at all. Do whatever you want.

43:10.421 --> 43:11.380
Mm-hmm.

43:11.463 --> 43:14.550
Oh. There were a lot of side dishes
in the fridge, so I made some stew for us.

43:14.633 --> 43:15.843
- Do you want any?
- Hey. Hey.

43:15.926 --> 43:18.554
It's my house,
my side dishes, my ingredients.

43:18.637 --> 43:20.389
What should we do after we eat?

43:20.472 --> 43:23.309
I can't be bothered to go out today.
You wanna play some games instead?

43:23.892 --> 43:25.352
You're not leaving?

43:25.436 --> 43:27.646
Why? Can't I stay longer? We're friends--

43:27.730 --> 43:29.732
Hey, you keep on saying
that we're "friends."

43:29.815 --> 43:31.275
What the hell is wrong with you?

43:31.358 --> 43:33.902
You want to be friends.
The best of friends. Don't you?

43:33.986 --> 43:36.322
- Hmm.
- All right, there you go.

43:36.405 --> 43:39.325
So let me hang out here as a friend.
That okay?

43:40.159 --> 43:42.870
All right, fine. Let's hang out all day.

43:44.371 --> 43:47.374
[bright music]

44:02.473 --> 44:03.766
[sighs]

44:08.896 --> 44:10.147
[phone buzzing]

44:13.400 --> 44:14.360
Hey, what's up?

44:14.443 --> 44:16.236
You have an interview today, remember?

44:16.320 --> 44:18.947
- [Eun-ho] I'll pick you up at two.
- Oh.

44:19.990 --> 44:22.326
[coughs]
Hey, could you cancel that for me?

44:22.409 --> 44:23.952
What? Why?

44:24.536 --> 44:26.497
[coughs]
Well, you know…

44:26.580 --> 44:28.791
I'm still not feeling that good.

44:28.874 --> 44:30.167
Are you still sick?

44:30.250 --> 44:31.835
I heard your fever went down.

44:31.919 --> 44:33.545
I'll just come over later then, okay?

44:33.629 --> 44:37.633
Oh, no, no, don't. Don't come over.
I'm going to sleep. Bye.

44:39.968 --> 44:42.179
[quirky music]

44:42.262 --> 44:44.098
[sighs, clears throat]

44:46.558 --> 44:47.851
[clears throat]

44:47.935 --> 44:48.936
Hey.

44:50.354 --> 44:54.608
Luckily, I don't have any plans today.
So I'll hang out with you.

44:54.692 --> 44:56.735
[chuckles]
All right, buddy.

44:57.528 --> 44:59.655
[quirky music continues]

45:04.284 --> 45:05.119
Eating?

45:07.579 --> 45:09.373
I'll get some myself.
[clears throat]

45:14.461 --> 45:16.588
[telephone ringing]

45:19.049 --> 45:21.552
Hey, Ji-ung. Didn't you go home yesterday?

45:21.635 --> 45:23.554
Wait, what are you doing here
on a weekend?

45:23.637 --> 45:26.723
Ah, I was helping Mr. Park
with a program he said he couldn't finish.

45:26.807 --> 45:29.393
Oh, why'd they contact you
without my permission?

45:29.476 --> 45:30.936
Don't do it. I'll talk to him.

45:31.019 --> 45:32.980
It's nothing much. I'll be done soon.

45:33.063 --> 45:36.483
Oh, yeah, I notified everyone that
we'll start filming again on Monday.

45:37.693 --> 45:40.320
And also,
I got a strange call a while ago.

45:40.404 --> 45:41.488
[Ji-ung] About what?

45:42.448 --> 45:44.908
[Chae-ran] I don't know
if what they said was true, but…

45:44.992 --> 45:45.826
What is it?

45:46.368 --> 45:49.163
They told me that
NJ wants to appear on our program.

45:49.246 --> 45:50.581
What? Who said that?

45:50.664 --> 45:52.249
Well, NJ herself.

45:53.500 --> 45:55.127
So she wants to appear as what?

45:55.210 --> 45:56.753
As Choi Ung's friend.

45:57.421 --> 45:59.798
- [game music]
- [controllers clicking]

46:01.425 --> 46:04.094
[upbeat music]

46:05.971 --> 46:07.514
[sighs deeply]

46:08.932 --> 46:11.226
[sighs]
I'm so stressed.

46:11.310 --> 46:13.770
So was that my third win or my fourth win?

46:13.854 --> 46:15.856
Why are you so good at this game anyway?

46:15.939 --> 46:18.484
Well, I guess it's harder to find
something I'm not good at.

46:18.567 --> 46:20.194
[sighs]
You're so annoying.

46:20.277 --> 46:21.987
Why don't you reflect
on your lack of skill

46:22.070 --> 46:23.864
instead of pinning the blame
on other people.

46:23.947 --> 46:25.908
We need to use our minds when playing too.

46:26.909 --> 46:28.368
Fine, just one more.

46:28.452 --> 46:30.537
[Yeon-su] Let's make it interesting.
Let's bet something.

46:30.621 --> 46:32.998
It won't be fun
if I just play with you for free.

46:33.081 --> 46:35.000
All right, what should we bet on then?

46:35.751 --> 46:37.711
- Give me a drawing.
- [scoffs]

46:37.794 --> 46:39.963
Hey. Do you even know
how much one of them costs?

46:40.047 --> 46:42.424
- You can win then.
- [disbelieving huff]

46:43.175 --> 46:46.053
All right, hang on.
Let me just get more juice.

46:46.136 --> 46:47.262
- [phone buzzing]
- Uh.

46:47.346 --> 46:49.097
Wait. Your phone's ringing.

46:49.181 --> 46:50.182
Probably Eun-ho.

46:50.265 --> 46:52.100
[buzzing continues]

46:54.978 --> 46:56.563
NJ

47:03.779 --> 47:05.197
- [thuds]
- [Ung groans]

47:05.280 --> 47:08.951
I guess you're pretty close
to that girl, aren't you?

47:09.034 --> 47:11.245
- Who?
- That famous singer.

47:12.996 --> 47:14.081
NJ.

47:15.749 --> 47:16.875
[Ung] Mm. Just a bit.

47:16.959 --> 47:18.710
[sighs]
Mm…

47:18.794 --> 47:20.546
You two seem to keep in touch,

47:20.629 --> 47:24.258
and she visits
even when she's really busy.

47:26.134 --> 47:29.221
Oh. So are you seeing each other?

47:29.721 --> 47:30.764
What?

47:30.847 --> 47:32.724
You're surprised? So are you?

47:33.809 --> 47:36.395
I mean, I was surprised
that you asked me that.

47:36.478 --> 47:39.273
Well, we're friends, aren't we?
Friends can ask stuff like that.

47:40.065 --> 47:43.402
Well, yeah, I guess so.
Since we're friends.

47:46.238 --> 47:47.990
Then let me ask you while we're at it.

47:48.865 --> 47:50.659
Is it true you were dating Mr. Jang?

47:51.702 --> 47:52.786
What?

47:52.869 --> 47:55.205
I can ask you that
since we're friends, right?

47:55.289 --> 47:57.708
We're just colleagues, nothing's going on.

47:58.375 --> 48:00.252
That's not what your other colleagues
seem to think.

48:00.335 --> 48:01.503
What do you mean?

48:02.629 --> 48:06.049
And speaking of,
since we're still on the topic now,

48:06.675 --> 48:08.927
how long have you been close to Ji-ung?

48:09.428 --> 48:10.262
Are you for real?

48:10.345 --> 48:12.222
You weren't that close to him back then.

48:12.306 --> 48:15.017
Wait… are you feeling jealous right now?

48:15.100 --> 48:16.768
- Yes.
- What?

48:16.852 --> 48:18.228
What?

48:19.229 --> 48:21.607
[light music]

48:22.566 --> 48:23.775
[clears throat]

48:25.902 --> 48:27.195
Um, I mean…

48:28.363 --> 48:31.158
don't steal Ji-ung away from me.
He's my friend too.

48:32.492 --> 48:33.493
[scoffs]

48:34.620 --> 48:36.163
[phone buzzing]

48:37.289 --> 48:38.790
NJ

48:40.417 --> 48:42.127
NJ

48:44.296 --> 48:45.672
[phone continues buzzing]

48:51.762 --> 48:54.222
[soft music]

49:01.563 --> 49:03.065
[music fades]

49:10.280 --> 49:11.156
Sol-i.

49:12.324 --> 49:15.243
If you take another step in here,
then I won't let you leave.

49:15.327 --> 49:17.371
You have to help me out with this.

49:18.580 --> 49:19.998
Hey, I was just passing by.

49:20.082 --> 49:22.042
You've been coming here
almost every single day.

49:22.125 --> 49:24.878
I know, right?
It's pretty here. And so is the owner.

49:24.961 --> 49:27.172
"And so is the owner."

49:27.255 --> 49:29.424
I already told you,
I don't date younger guys.

49:29.508 --> 49:32.678
Oh, you're serious? Well, thanks a lot!
You have to keep that promise!

49:32.761 --> 49:35.347
Hmm, why don't you come in for a minute?

49:35.430 --> 49:36.890
No, forget it. I'm not peeling onions.

49:36.973 --> 49:39.768
I'm going to peel something else too.
Come over here.

49:39.851 --> 49:42.437
- No can do. I gotta go.
- Where are you going?

49:42.521 --> 49:45.357
Hey. Stop bumming around
and go to work already.

49:45.440 --> 49:47.192
I was supposed to go to work today,

49:47.275 --> 49:49.194
but then Ung suddenly canceled on me.

49:49.861 --> 49:51.196
He said he's still sick,

49:51.279 --> 49:52.656
so I'm checking in on him.

49:54.366 --> 49:55.784
[inhales]
He told you he's sick?

49:55.867 --> 49:59.371
Yes. I know he said he was better,
but it looks like he's sick again.

50:00.038 --> 50:01.707
And he told me not to come.

50:01.790 --> 50:04.334
But still, as his manager,
I should check in on him.

50:04.418 --> 50:06.461
Wait. Don't. You shouldn't go there.

50:06.545 --> 50:07.796
Why?

50:07.879 --> 50:11.341
- Uh, I'm sure he has a guest.
- A guest? Who?

50:11.425 --> 50:13.969
Never mind.
Either way, you just shouldn't go.

50:14.052 --> 50:15.220
Just come over here.

50:15.303 --> 50:17.180
- Come on, stay with me today.
- I shouldn't.

50:17.264 --> 50:19.141
You promised me that you wouldn't do this.

50:19.641 --> 50:21.059
Forget it. I won't stay.

50:22.060 --> 50:24.604
Are you really going
to be a brat like that?

50:24.688 --> 50:27.107
Come over here while I'm being nice.
I'm good at throwing onions.

50:29.568 --> 50:30.694
[knocking on door]

50:32.571 --> 50:35.157
- [Ji-ung] Are you leaving?
- Yes. Aren't you gonna go home?

50:35.240 --> 50:37.033
I'm gonna work a little more. You can go.

50:37.117 --> 50:38.118
All right.

50:43.915 --> 50:45.083
Is there anything else?

50:46.501 --> 50:48.336
Ji-ung, do…

50:51.131 --> 50:52.966
you want to get dinner?

50:56.470 --> 50:59.431
I mean, you have to eat
if you're going to keep working tonight,

50:59.514 --> 51:02.601
and I don't have much time
to eat at home, so I thought we'd eat out…

51:02.684 --> 51:03.769
[Ji-ung] Yeah, no problem.

51:04.311 --> 51:06.354
Why do you need to explain so much?
Let's eat.

51:08.940 --> 51:10.692
We could have eaten out, you know.

51:11.401 --> 51:14.571
Uh, no, it's fine.
You have to work right away anyway.

51:14.654 --> 51:15.614
All right, then.

51:21.203 --> 51:23.997
[sighs]
Stop staring at me like that, spit it out.

51:25.582 --> 51:27.751
Well, it's… I just…

51:29.711 --> 51:31.379
What? Are you okay?

51:31.463 --> 51:34.508
Do you wanna transfer?
Or are you thinking of quitting on me?

51:34.591 --> 51:37.594
Don't you dare. You don't
get to quit before I do, you hear me?

51:38.178 --> 51:40.722
[chuckles]
No, it's not like that.

51:41.306 --> 51:42.474
Then what?

51:42.557 --> 51:45.435
Do you mind telling me
why you keep staring at me all the time?

51:46.144 --> 51:48.063
Do you have a crush on Ms. Kook?

51:52.192 --> 51:54.569
Oh, I'm so sorry.

51:54.653 --> 51:57.280
That was too personal for me to ask.

51:57.364 --> 51:59.658
[Chae-ran] I was just curious, that's all.

52:00.242 --> 52:01.076
I'm sorry.

52:02.118 --> 52:03.411
Well, if you're sorry…

52:05.705 --> 52:07.165
then keep this a secret.

52:07.749 --> 52:09.835
I've never told anyone about this.

52:12.379 --> 52:14.464
[light music]

52:15.423 --> 52:16.842
[deep inhale]

52:16.925 --> 52:19.636
But was it really obvious?
I sure hope not.

52:20.846 --> 52:23.473
I only noticed because I watching
how you were around her.

52:23.557 --> 52:26.059
So wait, you weren't focusing
on our shots then?

52:26.142 --> 52:28.103
- What a slacker.
- [chuckles]

52:28.937 --> 52:30.313
[cutlery clinking]

52:35.151 --> 52:37.696
- It's pretty cheap, huh?
- What?

52:38.280 --> 52:39.990
Lying like this to my friend

52:40.073 --> 52:42.200
and having feelings for her in secret.

52:43.076 --> 52:45.704
You can't control
how you feel about people.

52:46.288 --> 52:47.956
So are you taking my side?

52:48.039 --> 52:50.500
I guess it's nice to have a junior.
[chuckles]

52:53.420 --> 52:54.629
Don't worry.

52:54.713 --> 52:57.966
I'll plan to finish this project without
getting my personal feelings involved.

52:58.049 --> 53:00.135
[light music continues]

53:03.179 --> 53:05.473
[Yeon-su] Hey, I'm ordering chicken, okay?

53:05.557 --> 53:07.893
- [Ung] What's that?
- I said, I'm going to order chicken.

53:07.976 --> 53:09.185
[Ung] You're leaving?

53:09.269 --> 53:10.770
- [scoffs]
- [phone buzzing]

53:12.647 --> 53:13.815
[groans]

53:15.233 --> 53:16.443
[buzzes]

53:26.119 --> 53:27.621
[deep inhale]

53:27.704 --> 53:30.373
I shouldn't be spying
on other people's phones.

53:34.085 --> 53:36.129
[cheeky music]

53:37.631 --> 53:39.966
[inhales, groans]

53:43.219 --> 53:45.430
[groaning]

53:49.768 --> 53:51.144
But at the same time…

53:52.312 --> 53:55.148
I can't help it if I accidentally see it.

53:55.231 --> 53:56.566
And I keep my eyes closed.

53:58.026 --> 53:59.027
GU EUN-HO

54:00.904 --> 54:03.949
[Eun-ho] Ung, I rescheduled the interview
you canceled to next week.

54:04.032 --> 54:06.284
Hey, man, are you still
feeling sick or something?

54:06.368 --> 54:08.119
And are you sure I don't have to visit?

54:13.750 --> 54:15.877
He said he had no plans today.

54:16.461 --> 54:18.797
[Yeon-su] What in the world
is going through this guy's head?

54:20.048 --> 54:21.424
[sighs]

54:33.728 --> 54:34.938
[sighs deeply]

54:36.189 --> 54:37.983
Did she really leave?

54:42.612 --> 54:44.489
SBC BROADCASTING

54:44.572 --> 54:46.908
[gentle music]

54:52.163 --> 54:53.707
[sighs heavily]

54:53.790 --> 54:55.500
I don't wanna go home tonight.

54:56.710 --> 54:58.795
[gentle music continues]

55:00.839 --> 55:02.173
[vehicle whooshing]

55:12.642 --> 55:14.728
[gentle music]

55:19.691 --> 55:22.736
Hey, I never said you could go
snooping around my house, you know.

55:25.280 --> 55:27.615
[gentle music continues]

55:42.338 --> 55:44.507
[gentle music]

55:54.100 --> 55:55.060
[Ung clears throat]

55:55.143 --> 55:58.188
You can't do whatever you want
just because we're friends.

56:03.318 --> 56:04.694
So what's your plan?

56:05.779 --> 56:06.780
What?

56:06.863 --> 56:08.323
You were waiting until I came back

56:08.406 --> 56:10.658
so you could throw
salt and water on me, weren't you?

56:11.242 --> 56:12.660
[Yeon-su] You said
you'd film the documentary

56:12.744 --> 56:15.538
you yelled at me, bullied me,
hid and then reappeared.

56:16.206 --> 56:17.540
Then you kissed me.

56:18.708 --> 56:20.418
Now you want to be friends?

56:22.504 --> 56:24.714
I'm just curious about
what's going on in your head.

56:25.381 --> 56:26.716
I really want to know.

56:28.051 --> 56:29.803
I don't have any plans.

56:31.137 --> 56:34.265
I just wanna get along well with you.
What's the problem?

56:35.517 --> 56:36.643
But then…

56:41.314 --> 56:43.441
why do I feel
like you're lying to me right now?

56:46.111 --> 56:48.363
[soft music]

56:49.030 --> 56:50.240
[scoffs]

56:50.782 --> 56:52.242
You're so self-centered, you know.

56:53.368 --> 56:55.537
There's something I want to hear from you.

56:56.037 --> 56:58.998
Come to think of it,
you never said it to me, not once.

57:00.166 --> 57:01.751
[Yeon-su] So I want to hear it now.

57:02.335 --> 57:03.878
We keep pretending to be friends.

57:05.046 --> 57:06.756
I'm going to make plans of my own.

57:08.800 --> 57:10.051
Oh, by the way…

57:11.302 --> 57:13.680
This one. It'll be my reward.

57:15.682 --> 57:19.936
Say is this the old amusement park
where we broke up for the fourth time?

57:21.354 --> 57:22.480
I can have this, right?

57:24.399 --> 57:25.358
[disbelieving sigh]

57:25.442 --> 57:26.818
Leave. You can't stay here tonight.

57:26.901 --> 57:28.987
"Tonight"? Then other nights are okay?

57:29.070 --> 57:31.364
You're really being weird right now.
You know that?

57:31.448 --> 57:32.532
I was about to go.

57:35.160 --> 57:36.536
After I eat the chicken.

57:38.705 --> 57:40.874
[footsteps thumping]

57:46.421 --> 57:47.589
Is that the fried chicken?

57:47.672 --> 57:49.174
- [doorbell rings]
- I'll be right there!

57:55.096 --> 57:56.431
[both gasp]

58:00.935 --> 58:02.979
[soft music]

58:05.773 --> 58:07.775
What are you doing here so late?

58:10.195 --> 58:11.613
What about you two?

58:12.906 --> 58:16.284
[heart pounding]

58:16.367 --> 58:17.535
[sighs]

58:21.748 --> 58:24.083
Hello there. I'm Choi Ung's friend, NJ…

58:24.167 --> 58:25.585
EPILOGUE

58:25.668 --> 58:28.046
Can I use a fake name?
I didn't get permission yet.

58:28.129 --> 58:32.050
Or blur out my face?
No, wait. Then I'd look like a criminal.

58:32.634 --> 58:34.052
Let's just start filming.

58:35.720 --> 58:37.263
What would you like to know?

58:37.847 --> 58:39.516
Should I talk about Choi Ung then?

58:40.850 --> 58:42.393
It'll be so fun.

58:48.816 --> 58:51.402
Hey, you!
What's going on between you three?

58:53.321 --> 58:55.740
It looks like you guys got into a fight.

58:55.823 --> 58:56.866
[NJ chuckles]

58:58.409 --> 59:05.416
JUST FRIENDS

59:05.959 --> 59:08.294
["Drawer" by 10CM playing]

59:27.438 --> 59:29.274
[Yeon-su] What are they up to?

59:29.983 --> 59:31.985
- I like it.
- What?

59:32.068 --> 59:35.280
[Sol-i] You're not after some criminal.
You have a crush on him.

59:35.363 --> 59:36.781
[Yeon-su] Oh, Choi Ung!

59:40.660 --> 59:41.494
[Ji-ung] Yeon-su.

59:42.370 --> 59:44.831
Wait a minute. You wanna come up?

59:45.582 --> 59:47.750
[Yeon-su] I don't wanna
be friends with Ung.

59:47.834 --> 59:49.419
This is really bad.

59:50.044 --> 59:51.087
I guess I was wrong.

59:52.714 --> 59:54.299
I still have feelings for him.
